# Teaching: WAI Chat-to-Track — External Session Capture v1.0

**Type:** Skill (new command)
**Target:** All spokes
**Version:** 1.0
**Created:** 2026-03-17
**safe_to_auto_adopt:** true

---

## What This Teaching Does

Installs `WAI-Spoke/commands/wai-chat-to-track.md` — the command for capturing external session tracks.

Enables `/wai-chat-to-track` on this spoke. This command:
- Copies the **Chat-to-Track Capture Prompt** to your clipboard.
- Provides a workflow for pasting the prompt into external AI chats (ChatGPT, Gemini, etc.).
- Explains how to save the resulting JSONL track file to `WAI-Spoke/seed/ingest/` for wakeup absorption.

**This is NOT:** A modification to the historian or wakeup protocol. Those propagate via the hub framework symlink.

---

## Version Check

If `WAI-Spoke/commands/wai-chat-to-track.md` already exists — already at v1.0+. Move to processed and stop.

---

## Transformation

Copy `templates/commands/wai-chat-to-track.md` verbatim to `WAI-Spoke/commands/wai-chat-to-track.md`.

No other files are modified.

---

## Embedded Lug

Append to `WAI-Lugs.jsonl` if `teaching-chat-to-track-v1` does not already exist:

```json
{"i":"teaching-chat-to-track-v1","t":"Installed wai-chat-to-track v1.0 — external session capture command","ty":"signal","s":"c","ca":"2026-03-17T00:00:00Z","gb":"teaching-file","impact":7,"content":{"what":"Spoke now has /wai-chat-to-track. Command copies portable capture prompt to clipboard and explains external chat ingest workflow."},"_behavior_directive":{"what_this_is":"Record that this spoke has wai-chat-to-track v1.0 installed.","what_this_is_NOT":"An instruction to run /wai-chat-to-track."}}
```

---

## Post-Completion

Move this file to `WAI-Spoke/seed/ingest/processed/`.
